{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01454",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.59,
      "end_seconds": 2.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.37,
      "end_seconds": 12.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 13.43,
      "end_seconds": 16.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.83,
      "end_seconds": 20.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.8,
      "end_seconds": 37.35,
      "duration_seconds": 15.55,
      "text": "It's very heavy periods. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.1,
      "end_seconds": 41.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.92,
      "end_seconds": 66.35,
      "duration_seconds": 19.43,
      "text": "Well, when it starts I tend to get pressure in my pelvis as well. The pressure in my pelvis? That's been since yesterday. So, I was feeling tired at one point, but that's gone now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.51,
      "end_seconds": 74.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "A few quick ones: pain with sex or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.29,
      "end_seconds": 82.04,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "Let me think, no, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.87,
      "end_seconds": 86.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.14,
      "end_seconds": 92.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "I mean, um, no weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.27,
      "end_seconds": 99.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.36,
      "end_seconds": 103.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.63,
      "end_seconds": 108.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.83,
      "end_seconds": 112.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "My grandfather had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.95,
      "end_seconds": 128.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.94,
      "end_seconds": 135.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.74,
      "text": "Yeah, yes, nickel, it gives me a rash on my skin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.98,
      "end_seconds": 138.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Alright, any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.7,
      "end_seconds": 147.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.06,
      "end_seconds": 154.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.41,
      "end_seconds": 160.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.68,
      "end_seconds": 163.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.35,
      "end_seconds": 170.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.4,
      "end_seconds": 174.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.07,
      "end_seconds": 178.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.85,
      "end_seconds": 189.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Okay, do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.58,
      "end_seconds": 193.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "I have diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.12,
      "end_seconds": 198.95,
      "duration_seconds": 0.83,
      "text": "Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.5,
      "end_seconds": 206.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "I've, I've had arthritis in my knees, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.92,
      "end_seconds": 223.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.21,
      "end_seconds": 228.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Well, no, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.38,
      "end_seconds": 233.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.67,
      "end_seconds": 239.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "Metformin. I take it 500 milligrams, maybe, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.85,
      "end_seconds": 245.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Do you have the packet or the prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.55,
      "end_seconds": 255.95,
      "duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "text": "Uh, uh, no, it's at home. Naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.95,
      "end_seconds": 260.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.83,
      "end_seconds": 274.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.62,
      "end_seconds": 302.19,
      "duration_seconds": 14.57,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 118 over 75, temp 36.5 degrees. And pulse 74, BMI works out to 40.0, weight 90 kilos, height 150 centimetres, SpO2 98 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.92,
      "end_seconds": 308.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.2,
      "end_seconds": 310.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.63,
      "end_seconds": 314.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.82,
      "end_seconds": 330.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.04,
      "text": "The uterus feels enlarged and firm, about the size of a ten-week pregnancy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.13,
      "end_seconds": 345.12,
      "duration_seconds": 10.99,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Putting it all together, this looks most like heavy periods, possibly from fibroids. Another possibility is a hormonal cause."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.51,
      "end_seconds": 349.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Is this serious, um, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.33,
      "end_seconds": 380.46,
      "duration_seconds": 29.13,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like heavy periods, possibly from fibroids, but I'd like to confirm. I'd like to arrange a blood count for heavy periods. Keep a record of the bleeding with the pad count. I'm going to send a referral to the gynaecology clinic. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.79,
      "end_seconds": 384.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Thank you, that's clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.07,
      "end_seconds": 395.65,
      "duration_seconds": 10.58,
      "text": "A pelvic ultrasound is something we might do if this doesn't improve in a month. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 397.36,
      "end_seconds": 402.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Right, uh, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}